Long Description:
Scouts X": In the Resolve Pre-battle Abilities step, if every model in a unit has this ability, choose one: 

if the unit is in Strategic Reserves, set it up wholly within your deployment zone; 

if the unit is wholly within your deployment zone, it can make a Scout Move up to X"; 

or if the unit is embarked within a Dedicated Transport wholly within your deployment zone and every embarked model has Scouts, that Dedicated Transport can make a Scout Move.

Scouts X": In the Resolve Pre-battle Abilities step, if every model in a unit has this ability, choose one: 

if the unit is in Strategic Reserves, set it up wholly within your deployment zone; 

if the unit is wholly within your deployment zone, it can make a Scout Move up to X"; 

or if the unit is embarked within a Dedicated Transport wholly within your deployment zone and every embarked model has Scouts, that Dedicated Transport can make a Scout Move.
